  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DcemWeskeZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yHlVxSj.png\" alt=\"discord横幅\" width=\"140\" height=\"34\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>关于</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Visuality 是一款适用于 Fabric 加载器的 Minecraft 模组。这是一款简单的纯客户端外观模组，将为你的 Minecraft 世界添加大量新粒子效果，例如水晶闪光、生物受击粒子、史莱姆专用的自定义 Blob 粒子以及环境粒子。随着模组的更新，粒子库将持续扩充，敬请期待！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>配置</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你可以通过编辑 Minecraft 目录中 config 文件夹下的 visuality.json 文件来配置该模组，也可以直接通过 ModMenu 集成界面进行设置。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>展示</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b36gkYh.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZNvWWow.gif\" width=\"400\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NKeDOcG.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/896630240170889246/904458353206509618/circles_on_water_2.gif\" width=\"400\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>更多</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvisuality\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></strong></a></span></p>",
